------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      .settingsMenu()
--
-- Description: Adds options to the Settings menu
--
-- Method Type: Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
-- Return:
--   [Data Type] [Description]
